# Template for .credentials/yahoo-email.conf (a symlink to a real conf file
# under ~/.config/credentials/email/, never committed -- see
# .docs/agents/credentials-operations.md). Same key=value shape as every
# other file in that directory.
account=someone@yahoo.com
app_password=replace-with-a-yahoo-app-password
smtp_host=smtp.mail.yahoo.com
smtp_port=587
